  "zh": "# AI模型与硬件发布、游戏AI突破及隐私政策动态\n## AI 前沿\n- **FLUX 3 Image 模型发布**：新模型在细节和速度上双提升，意味着生成式图像又进了一步。\n- **ChatGPT Sites 功能上线**：让对话直接嵌入网页应用，扩展了ChatGPT的实用场景。\n- **Stratego AI 胜人类顶级选手**：AI在完美信息博弈中首次胜出，标志着推理能力的新突破。\n## 产品与硬件\n- **华为 Mate90 系列发布**：搭载全新AI芯片，影像和性能都有明显提升。\n- **北美 RTX 5090 线下限购**：高端显卡供应吃紧，限购反映市场需求仍然旺盛。\n## 政策与安全\n- **犹他州 VPN 法律被叫停**：法院认定技术不可行，隐私保护法律又遭挫折。\n- **OpenAI 数学顾问组提出要求**：外部专家呼吁更透明的模型审计，推动AI安全治理。\n- **Suncatcher 原型卫星入轨**：谷歌的太空AI计算平台首次升空，开启空间计算新尝试。",
  "en": "# AI image model, ChatGPT Sites, Stratego AI win, Huawei Mate90, RTX 5090 curb, Utah VPN law, OpenAI advisory, Google Suncatcher satellite\n## AI Frontier\n- **FLUX 3 Image Model Release**：The new model boosts both detail and speed, marking another step forward in generative imagery.\n- **ChatGPT Sites Feature Launch**：Users can now embed web apps directly in chats, expanding ChatGPT’s practical uses.\n- **Stratego AI Beats Top Player**：AI has defeated a human Stratego champion for the first time, showing a breakthrough in reasoning.\n## Products & Hardware\n- **Huawei Mate90 Series Launch**：The lineup features a fresh AI chip, delivering noticeable gains in imaging and performance.\n- **North America RTX 5090 Limited Sale**：High‑end GPU supply remains tight, and the offline purchase limit reflects strong demand.\n## Policy & Security\n- **Utah VPN Law Struck Down**：The court ruled the statute technically unfeasible, dealing a setback to privacy‑focused legislation.\n- **OpenAI Math Advisory Group Demands**：External experts call for greater model transparency and auditability to improve AI safety.\n- **Google Suncatcher Satellite Launch**：Google’s prototype satellite has reached orbit, testing an AI‑driven space computing platform."
